# ---- Generated bulk data ---------------------------------------------
# The Monte-Carlo sample dumps are 6000 rows each and carry no browsing
# value. Regenerate them with: python scripts/run_study.py
# Everything else in outputs/ is committed deliberately: the DOE design
# tables, the JMP scripts and results.json are the record of the study.
outputs/*_montecarlo.csv

# ---- LaTeX build products --------------------------------------------
# docs/figures/*.png is NOT ignored. The report will not compile without
# those figures, and they should be browsable on GitHub.
docs/*.aux
docs/*.log
docs/*.out
docs/*.toc
docs/*.lof
docs/*.lot
docs/*.bbl
docs/*.blg
docs/*.synctex.gz
docs/*.fls
docs/*.fdb_latexmk
